# Personal data. This repo tracks the agentic workflow only.
#
# These directories hold the user's actual career evidence, identity, and
# submitted applications. They are the input to the system, not part of it.
# Anyone cloning this repo supplies their own.

# Note: experiences/ is excluded by contents rather than as a directory, because
# git cannot re-include a file underneath an excluded directory.
experiences/*
!experiences/_template.md

profile/
resumes/

# The second repo that versions those three directories. See CLAUDE.md
# §Versioning the career data.
.git-private/

# Point-in-time copies of experiences/ taken before a schema change. Same
# personal data, same reason to stay untracked.
.experiences-backup-*/

# Build and OS noise
*.pdf
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
